WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.254
Ko‘p differensial tenglamalarni formulalar bilan yechib bo‘lmaydi.

2
00:00:05.254 --> 00:00:09.154
Masalan, y shtrix teng x kvadrat plyus y kvadrat.

3
00:00:09.154 --> 00:00:15.203
Bu darsda yechimni sonlar jadvali ko‘rinishida taqribiy topishni o‘rganamiz.

4
00:00:15.203 --> 00:00:17.512
Eng sodda usul — Eyler usuli.

5
00:00:17.512 --> 00:00:21.014
Uning qanchalik aniq ekanini ham o‘lchaymiz.

6
00:00:21.264 --> 00:00:26.441
Boshlang‘ich nuqtada og‘ish ma’lum: u f ning shu nuqtadagi qiymati.

7
00:00:26.441 --> 00:00:32.159
Urinma bo‘ylab qisqa h qadam yuramiz: yangi y teng eski y plyus h karra f.

8
00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:35.250
Keyin yangi nuqtadan yana shunday qadam.

9
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.422
Nuqtalarni tutashtirsak, Eyler siniq chizig‘i chiqadi.

10
00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:46.496
Masala: y shtrix teng x plyus y, y nolda bir, qadam nol butun o‘ndan bir.

11
00:00:46.496 --> 00:00:53.414
Birinchi qadam: f nol va birda bir, demak y bir teng bir butun o‘ndan bir.

12
00:00:53.664 --> 00:01:00.579
Ikkinchi qadam: og‘ish nol butun o‘ndan bir plyus bir butun o‘ndan bir, ya’ni bir butun o‘ndan ikki.

13
00:01:00.579 --> 00:01:03.484
y ikki teng bir butun yuzdan yigirma ikki.

14
00:01:03.484 --> 00:01:10.814
Shu tarzda besh qadamdan keyin, x nol butun o‘ndan beshda, taxminan bir butun yuzdan yetmish ikki chiqadi.

15
00:01:11.064 --> 00:01:14.990
Aniq yechim y teng ikki e daraja x minus x minus bir,

16
00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:20.841
x nol butun o‘ndan beshda u taxminan bir butun mingdan yetti yuz to‘qson yetti.

17
00:01:20.841 --> 00:01:22.841
Xato taxminan yuzdan yetti.

18
00:01:22.841 --> 00:01:30.470
Qadamni ikki marta kichraytirsak, xato ham taxminan ikki marta kamayadi: bu birinchi tartib, O katta h.

19
00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:36.029
Grafikda yo‘nalish maydoni va nol, bir nuqtadan o‘tuvchi aniq integral chiziq.

20
00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:42.768
Eyler siniq chizig‘i qavariq egri chiziqning urinmalari bo‘ylab ketadi va doim undan pastda qoladi.

21
00:01:42.768 --> 00:01:49.099
Lokal xato bir qadamda h kvadratga proporsional, lekin qadamlar soni bir bo‘lingan h ga teng,

22
00:01:49.099 --> 00:01:52.094
shuning uchun global xato h ga proporsional.

23
00:01:52.344 --> 00:01:54.249
Endi o‘zingizni tekshiring.

24
00:01:54.249 --> 00:01:59.893
Qadamni ikki marta kamaytirganda Eyler usulining global xatosi qanday o‘zgaradi?

25
00:01:59.893 --> 00:02:03.068
Videoni to‘xtating, javobni o‘zingiz tanlang,

26
00:02:03.068 --> 00:02:08.006
so‘ng izohni o‘qing va kerak bo‘lsa darsning tegishli qismiga qayting.
